    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60568" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύζῐκος</span></b> , ἡ,
			<u>Cyzicus</u>, <i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			4.14
		</span></i>, etc., cf. <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			12.8.11
		</span></i>:—Adj.
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κυζικηνικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, βάμμα</span>”
